r print.png", "id": "246912787875696", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031311_246912791209029_5540108180063733703_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LYflIIX0Yo8Q7kNvwElFtch&_nc_oc=AdpQvqmWjsCgtGxEpiKWJZ8B2jAHUWPP5x3Rb7rfHF82GCPE7Aanz-StLpViGFXDQQg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_6_VEa0BsdiXfLZ-Iuq0cdg5Qk_vwDQqmQ_cW3fx6dJA&oe=6A32B1EE"}, {"file_name": "Print 3.png", "id": "2170405556482566", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572950_2170405559815899_5420058398011207589_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4Cmuxl1ki70Q7kNvwH_msem&_nc_oc=AdqQxgZy6iYlRTgHOTnqUtHMnkfIjlG487NWFHzg2TAF0JItWZXr_U6V34nXEKRFyrs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_8zYInVqCaDF6Ttrg8q11v3XS2Qtyzcq9gys9TUPIzmA&oe=6A32C3AF"}, {"file_name": "Print 5.png", "id": "921050275807580", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974548_921050279140913_846272164452751718_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oACJsF21YKQQ7kNvwEUAMJF&_nc_oc=AdoHp8JmA7pzfq7CRcVYz3qeC4KN6U44ZfRP8A6FLK2qdAUORTFz3HO1U7R3c3MflkY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_THny8z76XrD1mZSzuwkKzM1VsUThR1eGxpUMKUJbsFw&oe=6A32B697"}, {"file_name": "Print 2.png", "id": "1288706015050300", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75641339_1288706018383633_3836298053771559642_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KWnNFmh2q8cQ7kNvwFAeOAM&_nc_oc=AdpGnnnqwcVTgwdU_C5cZJa32QbdPEAAVH55wItAW7ubCf3OuCxzCso-RryJATabvio&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-m1BVdGNG7vswacBHDfXByI33cGF7SMRn1lU8SjxUJJw&oe=6A32C051"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Final v.0.1 (eeve).png", "id": "945385240225978", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974721_945385243559311_50820886768660782_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g64kVtAvL30Q7kNvwGte1E9&_nc_oc=Ado5K_cCo2ETsFHElp9F6b8ahGrmRBZGgh9PsTSAUkzy7NAXxHIN_0JBE5dRHDi1Z5E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8pDbs_zS4V0D1ZX2fos2D_W8_-2QnGy4xdn6VMhQEV1w&oe=6A32C5FC"}, "display_name": "My Room", "keywords": [], "long_description": "My Room is the game experience that allows you to interact with your friends and also create your own world.\n\nCustomize your character and explore our two game modes: Playground & My Room.\n\nIn the Playground you will find yourself in a multiplayer environment surrounded by minigames that are available to play with others. These games include:\n- Soccer: score as many goals as you can\n- Air Hockey (Arcade): play with the AI or with another player\n- Basketball (Arcade): throw the balls and try to score points\n- Cornhole (Arcade): have fun trying to score as you play with the bean bags\n- Darts (Arcade): practice your aiming in the available stations\n- Mini Golf (Arcade): try to aim the hole at the mini golf courses\nThe multiplayer also includes voice/text chat for you to communicate with other players\n\nWhen in My Room, you will be able to customize your own space. You can choose between 3 different themed templates, explore and change it the way you prefer.\n\n* Find more information about the gameplay itself the app*\n\nUpcoming updates in the near future:\n- Game monetary system\n- Shop\n- More games\n- More rooms\n\nHave fun!", "short_description": "Play minigames along with your friends in a multiplayer environment or explore and customize your own room with this experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/terms-of-use/", "publisher_name": "VResearch Lab", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "ex